      <description><![CDATA[
<h4>eWiz is now labelled as a public beta</h4>
<p>Settings › About shows a Beta badge and a line on what that means, and the version under Updates reads "beta" too. The label goes away by itself at 1.0. Until then, <b>Report a Bug</b> in About is the most helpful thing you can do; it attaches the diagnostics for you.</p>
